      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAXI GRIN (6) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors four starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (30.14) at this track over 525m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Likely to feature again. PAW KATTIA (1) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (26.68) last time in a Grade 5 at Geelong. Form here is sound including two wins. Key runner on best form. ASTON BARRISTER (3) latest effort finished 2nd in a Grade 5 on September 4 over 460m at Geelong behind Blazing Turbo beaten 4.5 lengths (26.08). Looks one of the chances. SNOW ROAD (2) can run a bold race on best form.",
